  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "We were all to stand before the magistrates on Thursday. A higher Judge took the case first.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 6.34
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The aneurism burst the night after we caught him. They found him on the floor at dawn.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 8.0,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He was smiling, like a man who looks back on a useful life and his work well done.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 14.0,
      "seconds": 5.78
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Next evening Holmes and I talked it over by our fire. He was bitter, then amused.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 21.417,
      "seconds": 6.34
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "The question is what you can make people believe that you have done.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 28.875,
      "seconds": 3.64
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Simple? I call it anything but simple.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 33.542,
      "seconds": 3.59
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "The grand thing is to be able to reason backwards.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 38.458,
      "seconds": 2.95
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had begun in the road. The wheels were narrow: a cab, and no gentleman's carriage.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 43.042,
      "seconds": 6.54
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "On the clay path, two men: one very tall by his stride, and one in small, elegant boots.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 50.583,
      "seconds": 6.7
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The tall one walked in beside the well-dressed one, and only the tall one walked out.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 58.292,
      "seconds": 5.82
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "There was no wound, but hatred and fear were on the dead face. Poison, then, forced on him.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 65.542,
      "seconds": 7.1
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Then the ring. A murder done so slowly was a private wrong, and a woman was in it.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 73.667,
      "seconds": 6.31
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A telegram to Cleveland named an old rival in love. His name was Jefferson Hope.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 81.0,
      "seconds": 6.0
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "And who follows a man through London best? The man who drives him. The cabman.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 88.125,
      "seconds": 5.98
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "So his street boys went round every cab rank in London until they found the one.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 95.125,
      "seconds": 5.7
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A shilling a boy, and three days in all. He called it the simplest case he knew.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 101.833,
      "seconds": 5.62
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "From the road to the cab rank, every link held. There was not one break in the chain.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 108.875,
      "seconds": 6.2
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Your merits should be known. If you won't publish the case, I will.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 116.208,
      "seconds": 4.54
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He only smiled at that, and handed me the evening paper across the hearth.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 122.25,
      "seconds": 5.56
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The public, it said, had lost a sensational treat now that the man Hope was dead.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 128.833,
      "seconds": 5.12
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The credit for his capture went to the Scotland Yard officials, Lestrade and Gregson.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 134.958,
      "seconds": 5.32
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "And Mr. Sherlock Holmes, an amateur, might learn something in time from such teachers.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 141.292,
      "seconds": 6.72
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "That's the result of all our Study in Scarlet: to get them a testimonial!",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 149.542,
      "seconds": 4.72
    }
  ]
}